{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Market Intelligence Agent","description":"Deterministic market intelligence system using Pandas + NumPy","version":"2.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/v1/health":{"get":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Health check","description":"Returns API health status and which datasets are currently loaded.","operationId":"health_check_api_v1_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthCheck"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/status":{"get":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Dataset status","description":"Returns detailed metadata about every loaded dataset.","operationId":"get_status_api_v1_status_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/v1/upload-datasets":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Upload CSV datasets","description":"Upload up to three CSV files:\n- **blackbox**: BlackBox Products dataset\n- **magnet**: Magnet Keyword dataset\n- **keyword_classification**: Keyword Classification dataset\n\nAll files are optional per request.  Previously uploaded datasets remain in memory until replaced.","operationId":"upload_datasets_api_v1_upload_datasets_post","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_upload_datasets_api_v1_upload_datasets_post"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UploadResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/demand-strength":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Demand Strength","description":"Measures overall market demand health.\n\n**Datasets**: Magnet Keyword + BlackBox Products\n\n**Formula**: `Demand Strength = mean(norm_search_volume, norm_keyword_sales, norm_asin_sales, norm_revenue)` — each metric min-max normalised to 0-100.\n\n**Returns**: 0-100 score, top keywords by search volume, top products by sales.","operationId":"demand_strength_api_v1_demand_strength_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DemandStrengthResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/sales-momentum":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Sales Momentum","description":"Measures brand-level sales acceleration.\n\n**Dataset**: BlackBox Products (grouped by Brand)\n\n**Formula**: `Sales Momentum = mean(norm_sales_trend, norm_asin_sales)` aggregated at brand level, normalised to 0-100.\n\n**Returns**: fastest-growing brands, declining brands, market direction.","operationId":"sales_momentum_api_v1_sales_momentum_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SalesMomentumResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/revenue-momentum":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Revenue Momentum","description":"Measures revenue acceleration by brand.\n\n**Dataset**: BlackBox Products (grouped by Brand)\n\n**Formula**: `Revenue Momentum = mean(norm_revenue, norm_revenue_trend)` — revenue summed per brand, trend averaged, normalised to 0-100.\n\n**Returns**: top revenue-growth brands, declining brands, total market revenue.","operationId":"revenue_momentum_api_v1_revenue_momentum_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RevenueMomentumResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/bsr-efficiency":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"BSR Efficiency","description":"Measures revenue efficiency relative to BSR rank.\n\n**Dataset**: BlackBox Products\n\n**Formula**:\n1. `Norm BSR = (1 - BSR / max_BSR) × 100`  (lower BSR = better rank = higher score)\n2. `Norm Revenue = min-max normalised to 0-100`\n3. `Efficiency = (Norm Revenue × 0.6) + (Norm BSR × 0.4)`\n\n**Returns**: efficient products (top quartile), inefficient products (bottom quartile), market efficiency score.","operationId":"bsr_efficiency_api_v1_bsr_efficiency_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BSREfficiencyResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/demand-velocity":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Demand Velocity","description":"Measures how fast market demand is accelerating.\n\n**Datasets**: Magnet Keyword + BlackBox Products\n\n**Formula**: `Demand Velocity = (Normalized Sales Trend + Normalized Search Trend + Normalized YoY Growth + Normalized Revenue Trend) / 4` with min-max normalization.\n\n**Returns**: velocity score, market phase, strongest/weakest growth signals, validation stats.","operationId":"demand_velocity_api_v1_demand_velocity_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DemandVelocityResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/search-momentum":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Search Momentum","description":"Measures alignment between search growth and sales growth.\n\n**Datasets**: Magnet Keyword + BlackBox Products\n\n**Formula**: `Search Momentum = Normalized Search Trend * Normalized Sales Trend`.\n\n**Returns**: momentum alignment, healthy keywords, weak-conversion keywords, strongest/weakest products.","operationId":"search_momentum_api_v1_search_momentum_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SearchMomentumPhase2Result"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/search-intent-efficiency":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Search Intent Efficiency Index (SIEI)","description":"Finds keywords receiving clicks but under-converting.\n\n**Dataset**: Magnet Keyword\n\n**Formula**: `SIEI = ABA Total Conv. Share / ABA Total Click Share` with safe division and percentile-based ranking.\n\n**Returns**: highest/lowest efficiency keywords, market friction keywords, click-heavy low-conversion keywords.","operationId":"search_intent_efficiency_api_v1_search_intent_efficiency_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SIEIResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/market-concentration":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Market Concentration Index (HHI)","description":"Measures monopoly vs fragmentation using Herfindahl-Hirschman Index.\n\n**Dataset**: BlackBox Products\n\n**Formula**:\n1. `Total Revenue = SUM(Revenue)`\n2. `Brand Market Share = Brand Revenue / Total Revenue`\n3. `HHI = SUM((market_share * 100)^2)`\n\n**Returns**: HHI score, structure type, top brands by share, concentration distribution.","operationId":"market_concentration_api_v1_market_concentration_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HHIResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/market-report":{"post":{"tags":["Market Intelligence"],"summary":"Full Market Intelligence Report","description":"Runs all four engines and aggregates results into a structured business intelligence report.\n\n**Requires**: BlackBox dataset (mandatory). Magnet dataset (optional, enriches demand).\n\n**Returns**: JSON report with rankings, opportunity findings, risk findings, and Markdown narrative. Future-ready for PDF/HTML export.","operationId":"market_report_api_v1_market_report_post","parameters":[{"name":"top_n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Top N"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MarketReportResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}